Dark vintage 1980s Japanese studio equipment wallpaper texture for a phone app background, portrait orientation. An almost black surface of finely brushed titanium aluminum and dark smoked glass console casing with micro-machined hairline texture. Extremely low contrast and very dark overall, so white text placed on top stays easy to read. A faint warm fluorescent teal light leak along the left edge and a faint warm coral-orange indicator glow leak along the right edge, soft and dim. No buttons, no dials, no text, no logos, no people. Flat, even, front-on, like a luxury audio material sample.
